		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">progression</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">The worsening of a disease over time. This concept is most often used for chronic and incurable diseases where the stage of the disease is an important determinant of therapy and prognosis. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
