		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">trouble de la cognition</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Interference or disruption of cognitive processes. This term encompasses a large number of problems and issues associated with intellectual functioning and information processing. 2005 (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
