		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">clear colorless liquid secreted by the choroid plexus of the lateral, third, and fourth ventricles, and contained within the ventricular system of the brain and spinal cord and within the subarachnoid space. (source : CSP)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0040767"/>
