		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Fibrillin 1 wt Allele</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Human FBN1 wild-type allele is located in the vicinity of 15q21.1 and is approximately 237 kb in length. This allele, which encodes fibrillin-1 protein, plays a role in modulation of connective tissue structure. Mutations in the gene are associated with a number of congenital defects. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
