		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Perception, function</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Perceptual functions</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">The process by which the nature and meaning of sensory stimuli are recognized and interpreted. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="fr">Fonctions mentales spécifiques de reconnaissance et d'interprétation des stimulus sensoriels. (source : CISMeF)</skos:definition>
