		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">TAF8 RNA Polymerase II, TATA Box Binding Protein (TBP)-Associated Factor, 43kDa wt Allele</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Human TAF8 wild-type allele is located in the vicinity of 6p21.1 and is approximately 37 kb in length. This allele, which encodes protein TBN, is involved in the mediation of the transcription complex response to activator molecules. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
