		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">purine-nucléoside phosphorylase</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">An enzyme that catalyzes the reaction between a purine nucleoside and orthophosphate to form a free purine plus ribose-5-phosphate. EC 2.4.2.1. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
