		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">A research study that follows over time groups of individuals who are alike in many ways but differ by a certain characteristic (for example, female nurses who smoke and those who do not smoke) and compares them for a particular outcome (such as lung cancer). (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0009247"/>
	</owl:Class>

