		<skos:hiddenLabel xml:lang="fr">Herpès</skos:hiddenLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any inflammatory skin disease caused by a herpesvirus and characterized by the formation of small vesicles in clusters. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
