		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">SSP29</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">acidic (leucine-rich) nuclear phosphoprotein 32 family, member B</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acidic (Leucine-Rich) Nuclear Phosphoprotein 32 Family, Member B Gene</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">This gene plays a regulatory role in the propagation of pro-apoptotic events. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
