		<skos:hiddenLabel xml:lang="fr">SyndromeDeSweet</skos:hiddenLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Sweet</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Sweet's disease</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Neutrophilic Dermatosis, Acute Febrile</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Febrile neutrophil dermatosis</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Febrile neutrophilic dermatosis</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acute febrile neutrophilic dermatosis</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">GOMM-BUTTON DISEASE</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">AFND</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Sweet's syndrome</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Dermatose aiguë fébrile à neutrophiles</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Dermatose aiguë fébrile neutrophilique</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Dermatose aiguë fébrile à neutrophile</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Dermatose aigüe fébrile à neutrophile</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Dermatose aigüe fébrile à neutrophiles</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">dermatose neutrophile fébrile</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Dermatose neutrophile fébrile [Sweet]</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Condition characterized by large, rapidly extending, erythematous, tender plaques on the upper body usually accompanied by fever and dermal infiltration of neutrophilic leukocytes. It occurs mostly in middle-aged women, is often preceded by an upper respiratory infection, and clinically resembles ERYTHEMA MULTIFORME. Sweet syndrome is associated with LEUKEMIA. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="fr">Maladie caractérisée par de larges plaques érythémateuses sensibles sur la partie supérieure du corps, accompagnées de fièvre et d'une infiltration dermique de neutrophiles. Survient surtout chez les femmes d'âge moyen, souvent précédé par une infection respiratoire supérieure, tandis que le tableau clinique ressemble à un erythème multiforme. Le syndrome de Sweet peut annoncer une leucémie. (source : CISMeF)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0039082"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0743841"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C1290834"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C1709838"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0037284"/>
		<OntoAD:has_severity rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0439793"/>
		<OntoAD:has_finding_site rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C1123023"/>
	</owl:Class>

