		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">therapy adverse effect</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Effet indésirable, sans précision</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">the unintended, deleterious effects of licit therapies, that are properly administered; for adverse or side effects of pharmaceuticals use DRUG ADVERSE EFFECT; for erroneous administration of therapies see PATIENT SAFETY/MEDICAL ERROR. (source : CSP)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0009566"/>
