		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Initiation</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Transcription Initiation involves RNA polymerase (and usually other factors) binding at a specific gene promoter DNA site followed by local DNA unwinding and inauguration of the 5-prime to 3-prime biosynthesis of an RNA transcript complementary to the DNA template. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
