		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">artificial pumping of a fluid through a tissue or organ via blood vessels, especially to supply drugs or nutrients; for the concept of pumping of one's own blood through artificial means use EXTRACORPOREAL CIRCULATION. (source : CSP)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C1533685"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C1514818"/>
