		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Région lombaire</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Subdivision of back of trunk which is demarcated from the abdomen by the posterior surface of the anterior layer of the thoracolumbar fascia and the anterior surface of the lumbar vertebral column; together with the abdomen, it constitutes the abdominal segment of trunk. Examples: There is only one back of abdomen. (source : FMA)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0004600"/>
	</owl:Class>

	<owl:Class rdf:about="&OntoAD;C1708726">
