		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">DIMETHYLAMINOADAMANTANE 01 03 05</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">AMANTADINE derivative that has some dopaminergic effects. It has been proposed as an antiparkinson agent. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
