		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">ADEPT</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">A systemic therapy which ensures that a specific prodrug is not converted into the active moiety anywhere but at the sites where the enzyme-linked, tumor-specific antibodies have localized. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
