		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">p120-catenin</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Cadherin-Associated Src Substrate</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Catenin delta-1 (968 aa, ~108 kDa) is encoded by the human CTNND1 gene. This protein plays a role in receptor-mediated signaling. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
