		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">pierre</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">An abnormal concretion occurring mostly in the urinary and biliary tracts, usually composed of mineral salts. Also called stones. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
