		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Agents pesticides</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">pesticide</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Chemicals used to destroy pests of any sort. The concept includes fungicides (FUNGICIDES, INDUSTRIAL); INSECTICIDES; RODENTICIDES; etc. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
