		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Selenium and Vitamin E Efficacy Trial (SELECT) will provide more definitive evidence of the efficacy of these drugs in preventing prostate cancer. (from The NCI Strategic Plan to Reduce Health Disparities) (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
