		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">ponction</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">ponction chirurgicale</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Incision of tissues for injection of medication or for other diagnostic or therapeutic procedures. Punctures of the skin, for example may be used for diagnostic drainage; of blood vessels for diagnostic imaging procedures. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
