		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">CHEMOKINE, CXC MOTIF, LIGAND 2</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">This gene is involved in the regulation of angiogenesis. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
