		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Neural Growth</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Neuronal Growth</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Formation of NEURONS which involves the differentiation and division of STEM CELLS in which one or both of the daughter cells become neurons. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
