		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Diagnostic Technique</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">procédures diagnostiques</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Manoeuvres diagnostiques</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">acte professionnel diagnostique</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">A specific test or series of steps done to help diagnose a disease or condition. Mammograms and colonscopies are examples of diagnostic procedures. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
