		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">maladie cardiaque artériosclérotique</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">sclérose artérielle coronarienne</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Thickening and loss of elasticity of the CORONARY ARTERIES, leading to progressive arterial insufficiency (CORONARY DISEASE). (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
