		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Oriental American</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Persons living in the United States having origins in any of the original peoples of the Far East, Southeast Asia, or the Indian subcontinent. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
