		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Maladies de l'artère carotide</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Pathological conditions involving the CAROTID ARTERIES, including the common, internal, and external carotid arteries. ATHEROSCLEROSIS and TRAUMA are relatively frequent causes of carotid artery pathology. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
