		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Analyse d'association pangénomique</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Criblage d'association pangénomique</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">An analysis comparing the allele frequencies of all available (or a whole GENOME representative set of) polymorphic markers in unrelated patients with a specific symptom or disease condition, and those of healthy controls to identify markers associated with a specific disease or condition. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
