		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, 4th Edition</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Published by the American Psychiatric Association, the DSM is a listing of currently recognized mental health disorders and their diagnostic criteria, for children and adults. It includes statistical information on etiology, incidence, prevalence, age of onset and prognosis. The 4th edition was published in 1994. As new information becomes available subsequent editions are published. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="fr">Classification par catégorie des troubles mentaux fondés sur un ensemble de critères avec des propriétés définies. Elle est produite par l'Association Psychiatrique Américaine. (source : CISMeF)</skos:definition>
