		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">ischémie spasmodique cérébrale</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">AIT</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Diminished or absent blood supply to the brain caused by obstruction (thrombosis or embolism) of an artery resulting in neurologic damage. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
