		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Immunologic Deficiency Syndrome, Acquired</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">AIDS  Acquired immunodef synd</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">AIDS  Acquired immunodeficiency syndrome</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acquired immune def.syndr.NOS</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acquired human immunodeficiency virus infection syndrome</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acquired immunodeficiency synd</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Immunodeficiency due to human immunodefic virus infection</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Immunodeficiency due to human immunodeficiency virus infection</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Immunodef-hum immunodef virus</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acquired immune deficiency syndrome (AIDS)</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Autoimmune deficiency syndrome</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">sida</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">acquired immun-deficiency synd</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acquired immune defic. synd.</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acquired immune defic. syndr.</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acquired Immune Deficiency</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Acquired Immuno-Deficiency Syndrome</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">ACQUIRED IMMUNE DEFIC SYNDROME</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">ACQUIRED IMMUNO DEFIC SYNDROME</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">IMMUNOL DEFIC SYNDROME ACQUIRED</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">IMMUNODEFIC SYNDROME ACQUIRED</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">acquired immunodeficiency syndrome (HIV-1 stage 6)</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">acquired immunodeficiency syndrome (AIDS)</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">SIDA</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">SYND D'IMMUNODEFICIENCE ACQUISE</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Syndrome de déficience auto-immune</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Syndrome immuno-déficitaire acquis</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Syndromes d'immunodéficience acquise</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Syndr d'immunodéficience acquise</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Syndrome d'immunodéficience humaine acquise</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Syndrome immunodéficitaire acquis</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">An acquired defect of cellular immunity associated with infection by the human immunodeficiency virus (HIV), a CD4-positive T-lymphocyte count under 200 cells/microliter or less than 14% of total lymphocytes, and increased susceptibility to opportunistic infections and malignant neoplasms. Clinical manifestations also include emaciation (wasting) and dementia. These elements reflect criteria for AIDS as defined by the CDC in 1993. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="fr">Immunodéficience cellulaire acquise, associée à l'infection par le virus de l'immunodéficience humaine (VIH). Selon les critères du CDC définis en 1993, le sida correspond à un nombre de lymphocytes T CD4 inférieur à 200 cellules/microlitre ou inférieur à 14% des lymphocytes totaux, à une augmentation de la susceptibilité aux infections opportunistes et à l'apparition de néoplasies. Les manifestations cliniques incluent des pertes de poids (diarrhée) et une démence. (source : MSHFRE)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0019693"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0398795"/>
