		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Troubles olfactifs</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of or impaired ability to smell. This may be caused by OLFACTORY NERVE DISEASES; PARANASAL SINUS DISEASES; viral RESPIRATORY TRACT INFECTIONS; CRANIOCEREBRAL TRAUMA; SMOKING; and other conditions. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
