		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">DELIRIUM DEMENTIA AMNESTIC COGNITIVE DIS</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Troubles mentaux organiques</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">trouble mental organique</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Cognitive disorders including delirium, dementia, and other cognitive disorders. These may be the result of substance use, trauma, or other causes. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
