		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">las</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">The state of weariness following a period of exertion, mental or physical, characterized by a decreased capacity for work and reduced efficiency to respond to stimuli. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
