		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Autoimmune hemolytic anemia and autoimmune thrombocytopenia</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">A rare, chronic and relapsing autoimmune disorder of unknown etiology, characterized by the presence of immune thrombocytopenia and autoimmune hemolytic anemia. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
