		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">All deaths reported in a given population. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="fr">http://www.fnclcc.fr/fr/patients/dico/definition.php?id_definition=1070 (source : CISMeF)</skos:definition>
