		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">PERIODONTITE</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Desmodontite</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Inflammation and loss of connective tissues supporting or surrounding the teeth. This may involve any part of the PERIODONTIUM. Periodontitis is currently classified by disease progression (CHRONIC PERIODONTITIS; AGGRESSIVE PERIODONTITIS) instead of age of onset. (From 1999 International Workshop for a Classification of Periodontal Diseases and Conditions, American Academy of Periodontology) (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="fr">réaction inflammatoire des tissus entourant une dent ¤sl(periodontium)¤sl, en provenant en général de l'extension d'inflammation gingival ¤sl(gingivitis)¤sl dans le ¤slperiodontium¤sl. (traduit de 'From Dorland, 27th ed') (source : CISMeF)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0031090"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0410013"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0399561"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C1290888"/>
