		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">prévision du résultat</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">A prediction of the probable outcome of a disease based on a individual's condition and the usual course of the disease as seen in similar situations. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
