		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Soins gérés</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">organized health care service in which provider must seek prior approval of the decision to treat a patient; if approved , the location, amount and type of care to be provided is agreed upon. (source : CSP)</skos:definition>
