		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">literature review</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">review of the literature</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Article de revue</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Work consisting of published material which provides an examination of recent or current literature. Reviews can cover a wide range of subject matter of various levels of completeness or comprehensiveness based on analyses of publications on the subject. The presence of research findings or case reports does not preclude designation as a review. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;IntellectualProduct"/>
