		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Monitorage du malade</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">In medicine, to regularly watch and check a person or condition to see if there is any change. Also refers to a device that records and/or displays patient data, such as for an electrocardiogram (EKG). (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
