		<skos:hiddenLabel xml:lang="en">ApoptosisRegulationGene</skos:hiddenLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Apoptosis Regulation Genes encode Apoptosis Regulator proteins, which either promote or impede the initiation, progress, or rate of apoptosis. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
