		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Gènes de régulation</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Gènes de contrôle</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">gène de régulation</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">gène de contrôle</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Genes which regulate or circumscribe the activity of other genes; specifically, genes which code for PROTEINS or RNAs which have GENE EXPRESSION REGULATION functions. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
