		<skos:hiddenLabel xml:lang="en">SensoryProcess</skos:hiddenLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any neural process required for an organism to sense and interpret the dimensions of a sensory experience: modality, location, intensity and affect. [GOC:dph, ISBN:0721662544 'Dorland's Illustrated Medical Dictionary'] (source : GO)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0009240"/>
