		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Résistance à un médicament</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Diminished or failed response of an organism, disease or tissue to the intended effectiveness of a chemical or drug. It should be differentiated from DRUG TOLERANCE which is the progressive diminution of the susceptibility of a human or animal to the effects of a drug, as a result of continued administration. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
