		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">cellular carbohydrate metabolism</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">The chemical reactions and pathways involving carbohydrates, any of a group of organic compounds based of the general formula Cx(H2O)y, as carried out by individual cells. [GOC:jl] (source : GO)</skos:definition>
