		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Family Helicobacteraceae</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">A taxonomic family of bacterium in the phylum Proteobacteria that includes the genera Helicobacter, Flexispira and Wolinella, among others. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
