		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Hormones adéno-hypophysaires</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">hormone antéhypophysaire</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Hormones secreted by the adenohypophysis (PITUITARY GLAND, ANTERIOR). Structurally, they include polypeptide, protein, and glycoprotein molecules. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
