		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Skin AND subcutaneous tissue</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">A tissue sample that contains the epidermis, dermis, and subcutaneous adipose tissue. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
