		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Proptose</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Yeux protubérants</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Abnormal protrusion of both eyes; may be caused by endocrine gland malfunction, malignancy, injury, or paralysis of the extrinsic muscles of the eye. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
