		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Cocci gram positif</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Coques gram positif</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Coques à Gram positif</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">coque Gram positif</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Coccus-shaped bacteria that retain the crystal violet stain when treated by Gram's method. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
