		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Organic phosphorus compound</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">ORGANOPHOSPHORUS CPDS</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Composés organophosphorés</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">composé organique de phosphore</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">phosphate organique</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">organophosphate</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Organic compounds that contain phosphorus as an integral part of the molecule. Included under this heading is broad array of synthetic compounds that are used as PESTICIDES and DRUGS. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
