		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">leucocytaire</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">White blood cells. These include granular leukocytes (BASOPHILS; EOSINOPHILS; and NEUTROPHILS) as well as non-granular leukocytes (LYMPHOCYTES and MONOCYTES). (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
