		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">groupe nucléaire antérieur du thalamus, SAI</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Three nuclei located beneath the dorsal surface of the most rostral part of the thalamus. The group includes the anterodorsal nucleus, anteromedial nucleus, and anteroventral nucleus. All receive connections from the mamillary body and fornix, and project fibers to the cingulate body. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0228315"/>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0039727"/>
