		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">EKG</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">ECG (ÉlectroCardioGraphie)</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Recording of the moment-to-moment electromotive forces of the HEART as projected onto various sites on the body's surface, delineated as a scalar function of time. The recording is monitored by a tracing on slow moving chart paper or by observing it on a cardioscope, which is a CATHODE RAY TUBE DISPLAY. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
