		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Tumeurs des voies respiratoires</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">new abnormal tissue of the respiratory system that grows by excessive cellular division and proliferation more rapidly than normal and continues to grow after the stimuli that initiated the new growth cease; use when broadly discussing the tubular and cavernous organs and structures in which pulmonary ventilation and gas exchange between ambient air and the blood are brought about. (source : CSP)</skos:definition>
