		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">ligase</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">A class of enzymes that catalyze the formation of a bond between two substrate molecules, coupled with the hydrolysis of a pyrophosphate bond in ATP or a similar energy donor. (Dorland, 28th ed) EC 6. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0014442"/>
