		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Angiotensine</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Oligopeptides which are important in the regulation of blood pressure (VASOCONSTRICTION) and fluid homeostasis via the RENIN-ANGIOTENSIN SYSTEM. These include angiotensins derived naturally from precursor ANGIOTENSINOGEN, and those synthesized. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
