		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any constituent part of a membrane, a double layer of lipid molecules that encloses all cells, and, in eukaryotes, many organelles; may be a single or double lipid bilayer; also includes associated proteins. [GOC:jl] (source : GO)</skos:definition>
		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C1178969"/>
		<OntoAD:part_of rdf:resource="&OntoAD;C0596901"/>
	</owl:Class>

