		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Proteinase Gene</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">A gene that encodes an enzyme that is capable of hydrolyzing the peptide bonds found between amino acids in proteins. (source : NCI)</skos:definition>
