		<skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Tissu lymphatique</skos:altLabel>
		<skos:definition xml:lang="en">Specialized tissues that are components of the lymphatic system. They provide fixed locations within the body where a variety of LYMPHOCYTES can form, mature and multiply. The lymphoid tissues are connected by a network of LYMPHATIC VESSELS. (source : MSH)</skos:definition>
